    "created_at": "2026-02-03T13:11:38Z",
    "updated_at": "2026-02-03T13:11:47Z",
    "body": "> Perhaps we should require an attribute for the \"object-of-the-same-shape\" type though and try to outlaw it in the normal case.\n\nI wonder whether we would want to automate that:\n\n```webidl\ninterface FooInt { /* ... */ };\ndictionary FooDict : FooInt {}; // Implicitly gets all attributes of the interface?\n```",
